OL,3,GNEWSAGurkha cookbook marks 12 years of
OL,4,Afriendship
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Gurkha cookbook bringing together
OL,7,FBritish and Nepali family recipes has
OL,8,Fbeen released to mark 12 years of
OL,9,Ffriendship between the communities.
OL,11,FThe Kukri Kitchen Cookbook is a
OL,12,Fcollaboration between the Reading
OL,13,FGurkha Ladies Project and SSAFA, the
OL,14,FArmed Forces charity.
OL,16,FFeaturing a foreword by Gurkha
OL,17,Fcampaigner Dame Joanna Lumley, it
OL,18,Fcelebrates the initiative that has
OL,19,Fhelped Gurkha wives settle into life in
OL,20,Fthe UK.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
